# Lockstep — developer route plan
R B:2.95,6 for 1             # magenta high on the back wall
R until x>=12.5              # over the timed button, off the plateau
R until air
R A:15,29 for 1              # cyan on the pit floor
L until vx<=0.2
- until tele                 # fling: past the beam, through the timed door
- until grounded
R until x>=109.4             # over the second button, through two beams and the second door
RJ until grounded            # hop the spikes
R until finished
